      "type": "product"
    }
  ],
  "features": [
    "Continuous non-impact torque output",
    "Compact planetary gearbox",
    "Seven-vane high-performance air motor",
    "Single-hand forward and reverse control",
    "Full reverse torque capability for bolt removal",
    "Designed for continuous-duty industrial operation",
    "Standard torque accuracy ±5% with ±1% repeatability",
    "Optional digital air regulation supports ±3% torque accuracy with ±1% repeatability",
    "Noise level below 80 dBA at maximum power"
